+
+        The returned reader does not close ``file``; the caller keeps ownership of it.
+
+        Args:
+            file (BinaryIO): An already-open binary file-like object.
+            total (int, optional): Total number of bytes to read. Defaults to the total of ``task_id``.
+            task_id (TaskID, optional): An existing task to advance. Default is a new task.
+            description (str, optional): Description of the task, if a new task is created. Defaults to "Reading...".
+
+        Returns:
